WEBVTT

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.687
Both green: one step exposes conflicting permission to cross.

00:00:05.687 --> 00:00:11.987
Always red: the conflicting-green check passes, but neither road gets a turn.

00:00:11.987 --> 00:00:20.400
North priority: a repeating north-green state can leave east–west waiting forever.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:33.324
Take turns: finite green, yellow and clearance intervals give both roads a turn.

00:00:33.324 --> 00:00:39.378
More north green changes the tradeoff: east–west now waits up to 14 ticks for green.
